    "detailed_description": "<h1>\u26a0\ufe0f\u2757\u2757 Important Notice: Location Permission Pop-Up \u2757\u2757\u26a0\ufe0f</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello everyone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for your continued support! We\u2019ve recently received a few reports about a location permission pop-up appearing in our games. If you see this prompt, feel free to <strong><i><u>decline it</u></i></strong>. The game should work just fine without needing any location data. Rest assured, we haven\u2019t programmed our games to request location access.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re actively looking into what\u2019s causing this. For context, our games are built using the Construct 3 engine, which relies on HTML5 technology, and this might be related to the issue. One possibility (though we\u2019re not certain yet) is that a recent Windows update could be triggering these prompts for web-based applications.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you encounter this pop-up, we\u2019d greatly appreciate it if you could take a screenshot and send it to us at <u>ub@noobzilla.games</u>. Your help will go a long way in helping us resolve this!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for your understanding, and we apologize for any inconvenience. We truly value your support!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Best regards,<br>UB</p></p><br><h1>\ud83d\udc9a\ud83d\udc9a MORE UPCOMING GAMES! \ud83d\udc9a\ud83d\udc9a</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925310/extras/9b846d80537cfd83dd3d2be20ae35cf5.poster.avif?t=1751631804\" width=800 height=227 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925310/extras/9b846d80537cfd83dd3d2be20ae35cf5.webm?t=1751631804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\ud83c\udfae 4 pages comic and jigsaw Puzzle<br></li><li>\ud83d\ude3b 204 cats<br></li><li>\ud83d\udcf7 Photo mode<br></li><li>\ud83d\udd06 Brightness setting<br></li><li>\ud83c\udfa8 Choose your favorite color<br></li><li>\ud83c\udfb5 4 Musics<br></li><li>\ud83d\udd14 Free hints<br></li><li>\ud83d\udcbe Save system<br></li><li>\ud83d\udd0d Zoom<br></li><li>\ud83d\udd09 Cute cat sounds<br></li><li>\ud83c\udfae Gamepad compatible</li></ul><br><table><tr><th><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925310/extras/9bb63dae48437d8fbd64044f95db9261.poster.avif?t=1751631804\" width=616 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925310/extras/9bb63dae48437d8fbd64044f95db9261.webm?t=1751631804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925310/extras/9bb63dae48437d8fbd64044f95db9261.mp4?t=1751631804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Hi, welcome our experimental hidden cat project. Cats Around Us is a series that introduces wholesome silent comics as a new medium for gameplay.<br><br><strong>&quot;Giant Cat&quot;</strong> unfolds across four pages of silent comic panels by Kathrinna Rakhmavika, offering a heartwarming tale about a giant cat causing chaos in a village. A young witch must step in to resolve the situation. Throughout each page, we've hidden numerous cats for you to find while enjoying the story.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925310/extras/141431f3e69a5e580e8fecda063bbf09.poster.avif?t=1751631804\" width=462 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925310/extras/141431f3e69a5e580e8fecda063bbf09.webm?t=1751631804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925310/extras/141431f3e69a5e580e8fecda063bbf09.mp4?t=1751631804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Additionally, we've included a photo mode for players to capture intriguing moments from the comic, allowing them to colorize and share their creations with the world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925310/extras/fb795fdc2d5584763df3a1a20df61c35.poster.avif?t=1751631804\" width=462 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925310/extras/fb795fdc2d5584763df3a1a20df61c35.webm?t=1751631804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925310/extras/fb795fdc2d5584763df3a1a20df61c35.mp4?t=1751631804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925310/extras/c81fa7167fdb3615313064fa52cf47ac.poster.avif?t=1751631804\" width=616 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925310/extras/c81fa7167fdb3615313064fa52cf47ac.webm?t=1751631804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925310/extras/c81fa7167fdb3615313064fa52cf47ac.mp4?t=1751631804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></th></tr></table>",
